---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Your Law Firm Looks Dialed In. It Doesn't Always Run That Way. | Attorney Assistant"
  description="Clients see professionalism and confidence. Behind the scenes, missed calls and inconsistent follow-up quietly cost you cases. Attorney Assistant fixes the backend."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Your Law Firm Looks Dialed In. It Doesn't Always Run That Way.",
    "description": "Clients see professionalism and confidence. Behind the scenes, missed calls and inconsistent follow-up quietly cost you cases. Attorney Assistant fixes the backend.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <!-- Animated grid lines -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Growing Law Firms
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            Your law firm looks dialed in. It doesn't always <span class="text-gradient-gold">run that way.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Clients see professionalism and confidence. Behind the scenes, missed calls and inconsistent follow-up quietly cost you cases.
          </p>

          <!-- Animated stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="78">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">%</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">of clients sign with the first firm that responds</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="5">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">min</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">is the window before a lead goes cold</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="40">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">%</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">of calls to law firms go unanswered</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What you get on the call -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 21l-5.197-5.197m0 0A7.5 7.5 0 105.196 5.196a7.5 7.5 0 0010.607 10.607z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Where your intake breaks down</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">We'll trace the path from lead to signed client and find the gaps.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v12m-3-2.818l.879.659c1.171.879 3.07.879 4.242 0 1.172-.879 1.172-2.303 0-3.182C13.536 12.219 12.768 12 12 12c-.725 0-1.45-.22-2.003-.659-1.106-.879-1.106-2.303 0-3.182s2.9-.879 4.006 0l.415.33M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">What inconsistency is costing you</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Real numbers on missed opportunities, not guesswork.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">How to fix it without overhauling your team</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Practical changes that work with your current staff.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free consultation
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              We integrate with your team
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Call</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/professional-meets-absurd?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scroll indicator -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 2 — "The Disconnect" calendar view
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">The Disconnect</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            From the outside, your firm is exactly what it should be.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Clients meet with your team. Conversations feel strong. Cases are moving forward. Everything about the experience says "this firm has it together."
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            But what happens before and after those moments is less predictable. Nothing is completely broken. It's just not consistent.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            The front of the firm works. The backend is doing its best to keep up.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: Day calendar view -->
        <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-cal">
            <!-- Calendar header -->
            <div class="lp-cal-header">
              <div class="lp-cal-header-left">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.75 2a.75.75 0 01.75.75V4h7V2.75a.75.75 0 011.5 0V4h.25A2.75 2.75 0 0118 6.75v8.5A2.75 2.75 0 0115.25 18H4.75A2.75 2.75 0 012 15.25v-8.5A2.75 2.75 0 014.75 4H5V2.75A.75.75 0 015.75 2z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                <span>Today &mdash; A Typical Day</span>
              </div>
              <div class="lp-cal-header-status">
                <span class="lp-cal-status-dot lp-cal-status-dot--red"></span>
                4 issues
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Time slots -->
            <div class="lp-cal-body">
              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">9:02a</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--red">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--red"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">Incoming Call &mdash; Voicemail</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--red">Missed</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">Team was in a client meeting. Lead left a message nobody checked until 2pm.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">11:45a</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--amber">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--amber"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">Web Lead &mdash; Slow Response</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--amber">Delayed</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">Form submitted at 9am. First response came 3 hours later.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">2:20p</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--amber">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--amber"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">Follow-Up &mdash; Dropped</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--amber">Stalled</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">One call back made. No answer. No second attempt scheduled.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="lp-cal-slot">
                <div class="lp-cal-time">7:10p</div>
                <div class="lp-cal-event lp-cal-event--red">
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-bar lp-cal-event-bar--red"></div>
                  <div class="lp-cal-event-content">
                    <div class="lp-cal-event-row">
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-title">After-Hours Call &mdash; No Coverage</span>
                      <span class="lp-cal-event-badge lp-cal-event-badge--red">Lost</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="lp-cal-event-desc">Prospective client called after 5pm. Nobody available. They hired another firm.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Calendar footer -->
            <div class="lp-cal-footer">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16.023 9.348h4.992v-.001M2.985 19.644v-4.992m0 0h4.992m-4.993 0l3.181 3.183a8.25 8.25 0 0013.803-3.7M4.031 9.865a8.25 8.25 0 0113.803-3.7l3.181 3.182" /></svg>
              <span>Not broken. Just inconsistent. And that's enough.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 3 — "The Cost of Inconsistency"
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[800px] bg-red-500/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border border-red-500/20 mb-6">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          The Cost of Inconsistency
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-4">
          You don't lose clients in the meeting.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">You lose them before you ever get there. And because it happens quietly, it keeps happening.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8 reveal">
        <div class="lp-cost-card">
          <div class="lp-cost-card-icon lp-cost-card-icon--red">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading text-white mt-5 mb-2">Leads that don't get a fast response</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">When someone reaches out and doesn't hear back quickly, they move on. Not out of anger &mdash; out of urgency.</p>
          <div class="lp-cost-card-line lp-cost-card-line--red"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="lp-cost-card">
          <div class="lp-cost-card-icon lp-cost-card-icon--amber">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading text-white mt-5 mb-2">Follow-up that starts strong then fades</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">First call gets made. Maybe a voicemail. Then things get busy and the lead goes cold.</p>
          <div class="lp-cost-card-line lp-cost-card-line--amber"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="lp-cost-card">
          <div class="lp-cost-card-icon lp-cost-card-icon--navy">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-heading text-white mt-5 mb-2">Gaps in coverage nobody sees</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">After-hours, weekends, lunch breaks. The moments nobody's watching are the moments that cost you.</p>
          <div class="lp-cost-card-line lp-cost-card-line--blue"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 4 — "Enter Attorney Assistant"
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">The Fix</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
            We bring structure to the part of your firm that's currently <span class="text-gradient-gold">unpredictable.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            We step into intake and follow-up and make it consistent, reliable, and visible. This is not about adding more noise. It's about making sure what's already happening actually works.
          </p>
          <a href="#book-now" class="btn-primary btn-lg group inline-flex">
            Book Your Call
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 reveal" style="transition-delay: 200ms">
          <div class="lp-fix-card-v2">
            <div class="lp-fix-card-v2-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-heading text-white mt-3 mb-1">Calls Answered Live</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">When leads call, someone picks up. Not a recording.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-fix-card-v2">
            <div class="lp-fix-card-v2-icon lp-fix-card-v2-icon--blue">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-heading text-white mt-3 mb-1">Fast Lead Response</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Minutes, not hours. Before they move on.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-fix-card-v2">
            <div class="lp-fix-card-v2-icon lp-fix-card-v2-icon--purple">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.752 15.002A9.718 9.718 0 0118 15.75c-5.385 0-9.75-4.365-9.75-9.75 0-1.33.266-2.597.748-3.752A9.753 9.753 0 003 11.25C3 16.635 7.365 21 12.75 21a9.753 9.753 0 009.002-5.998z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-heading text-white mt-3 mb-1">Consistent Follow-Up</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Not one try and done. Persistent until they're reached.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-fix-card-v2">
            <div class="lp-fix-card-v2-icon lp-fix-card-v2-icon--green">
